{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"写的是尚无对象的内在躁动、说不清的等待和无法安顿的状态，没有新增具体经历、身份或外部事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"怕认命、怕失去、硬撑与想停都是心理状态，其中“硬撑着不肯垮下去”仍是心理层面的比喻，没有写成真的挺直背脊或倒下。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“那感觉再清楚，也带不回过去”把B4中比喻性的旧场景和记忆写成了他确有一段无法挽回的过去，新增了实际往事的暗示。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"保留了刚觉得能够行动、舍不得又浮现、确信再次动摇以及因非得想透才肯动而难堪的心理过程，没有新增具体的舍不得对象。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"从无对象的不安、害怕认命和失去，到被牵引着想行动、随后再次犹豫，整体心理推进清楚，S01-3虽然越界但不妨碍理解。跨段箭头不存在，因此无需核对前因关系。\",\n  \"lost\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R3\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"原文明确写了他想找到一个足够有力的理由，盼着自己终于不再犹豫；修补后只说“找理由让自己往前”，没有完整保留他希望借此彻底摆脱犹豫的明确愿望。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S01-1\",\n        \"S01-2\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"“不肯停的劲”“不想就这么算了”和“硬撑着不肯垮下去”连续表达不愿放弃，前两处尤其接近，存在重复。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S01-2\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"一条里连续塞进不想认命、硬撑、害怕失去和想停下来四层意思，信息过密，削弱了各层心理冲突之间的关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S01-3\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"“那感觉再清楚，也带不回过去”直接复述B4的记忆与过去之喻，还把它写成实际往事；删去这部分既能避免越界，也不影响寻找理由、试图向前的心理线索。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a0061299-ea3c-414e-9771-e1d7f919867f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T172226040772Z", "elapsed_seconds": 378.828, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T17:28:44.880508+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8978fafb0e20f8cf837a44c806dc8c05c447e669504034d77548888443e5947b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T172226040772Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "026d2ee3dba40f33ebe73ce4404b07f1b048044247d6d9299b793d37fdbae662"}}}
